---
title: Order state machine (author 523C0007, AI-assisted)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Placed : confirmOrder() [hub not busy] / save order, authorise payment
    Placed --> Confirmed : confirm() by kitchen
    Placed --> Cancelled : cancel() by customer / void payment, return voucher use
    Placed --> Rejected : reject(reason) by kitchen / void payment, return voucher use
    Confirmed --> Preparing : startPreparing()
    Preparing --> ReadyForPickup : markReady()
    ReadyForPickup --> OutForDelivery : pickUp() by shipper
    OutForDelivery --> Delivered : confirmDelivered() / capture or collect payment
    OutForDelivery --> DeliveryFailed : reportFailure(reason) / void payment
    Delivered --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    DeliveryFailed --> [*]
    note right of Placed
        Active states (Placed, Confirmed,
        Preparing) count toward hub load
    end note
